            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.138.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "138:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Danieli, ku yaamanyire ngu ekiragiro kyateebwaho omukono, yaataaha omu nju ye; (kandi amadirisa g'omu kishengye kye ky'ahaiguru gakaba gaigwire nigareeba Yerusaalemu) yaaguma naatsimba amaju kashatu buri izooba omu maisho ga Ruhanga we, naashaba kandi naasiima, nk'oku yaabaire atwaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eizooba rimwe abo bashaija baija n'omutima gumwe, baashanga Danieli naashaba kandi naayeshengyereza omu maisho ga Ruhanga we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima baaza omu maisho g'omugabe, baagamba aha by'ekiragiro kye, nibabagira bati: Nyakusinga, hari totaire omukono aha kiragiro ekirikugira kiti: Omu biro makumi ashatu omuntu oraashabe ruhanga weena nari omuntu weena otariiwe, anagwe omu kiina ky'entare? Omugabe yaagarukamu ati: Ekyo kiragiro nikwo kiri, n'ekiragiro kihamire, nk'oku ebiragiro by'Abameedi n'Abaperesi bitahindurwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baamugarukamu bati: Eryo ihano Danieli ow'omu Bayuda abaanyagirwe tarikukwetaho, Nyakusinga n'obu kwakuba okweta aha kiragiro eki otaireho omukono; kureka naashaba kashatu buri izooba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
